# Lead: P1 swept through all 16 ratio steps under a held note at index 150 (steps change the timbre, never click).
tempo 100
steps 32
tail 1.5
track lead
param p2 150
param sustain 255
param release 40
sweep p1 0 255 0 32
note 0 A3 32 100
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
expect idle 40      # release 40: ~0.9 s to -66 dB
